WEBVTT

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:07.690
<i>I truly love Onee-chan.</i>

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:10.930
<i>She always tries her best at school and at work.</i>

00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:12.620
<i>So to encourage her,</i>

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:15.830
BIG 3-DAY SALE!!

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:15.830
Pork Tenderloin

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:15.830
Vegetables

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:15.830
Green Peppers

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:15.830
White Radish

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:20.230
<i>tonight’s dinner will be cooked white radish, white radish miso soup, and white radish salad.</i>

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:22.190
<i>It’ll be fine.</i>

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:24.000
<i>To balance the meal,</i>

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.330
<i>I’ll add in yesterday’s cabbage along with some three-day-old potato leftovers.</i>

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:33.300
<i>But today’s main ingredient will definitely be white radishes.</i>

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.020
<i>That is…</i>

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:36.520
I’m home.

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:40.260
Welcome home, Onee-chan!

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:40.920
Look, look!

